(The 2T-TL820-BA is for U.S. users, but an equivalent package is available
for European users, with installation, on a quotation basis; local Digital
sales offices can provide more information on obtaining this package.) The
TL820-AC is an add-on unit for expandability and requires a base library
unit.

System Support

The TL820 library is being initially supported on DEC 3000, 4000, 7000, and
10000 systems under OpenVMS AXP V1.5 and on VAX 6000, 8000, 9000, 11/750,
and 11/780 systems under OpenVMS V5.5-2 or later. Support under DEC OSF/1
V2.0 is also being provided when the library is used with POLYCENTER
NetWorker Save and Restore software (SPDs 50.99, 51.01, 51.02, and 51.03).

Application Software

Use of the TL820 DLT library requires robotics and media management
software. Users have a growing number of Digital and third-party options for
the integration of the TL820:

o  Users who purchase 2T-TL820-BA receive DECLS software and service. DECLS
   provides software connectivity under the OpenVMS VAX operating system to
   SLS, Tapesys from Software Partners, and UIS Archive from Raxco. DECLS
   also provides support for the TL820 under the OpenVMS AXP operating
   system.

o  Users running the DEC OSF/1 operating system can utilize POLYCENTER
   NetWorker Save and Restore V2.2B for support.

o  Branches from Acorn Software also supports the TL820 under the OpenVMS
   VAX and OpenVMS AXP operating systems.

TL820 Library Unit Specification Highlights

