   deep.
o  Weight: 784 lb (356 kg) with drives, unloaded.
o  Power: 90 to 135 V and 176 to 264 V, autoranging, at 47 to 63 Hz.
o  MSBF: 500,000 cartridge exchange cycles.

Tape Drive Specification Highlights

o  Transfer rate: up to 1.25 Mbytes per second native, up to 2.5 Mbytes per
   second compressed.
o  Maximum capacity: 20 Gbytes.
o  Durability: 500,000 tape-head passes.

NOTE: These performance statistics reflect only the drive capabilities;
      actual drive performance is a function of the system configuration and
      its application.

