o  Client/server toolset allows use of PC and Macintosh applications (such
   as spreadsheets and Visual Basic or any DDE capable application) to
   analyze and manipulate data from manufacturing process systems

o  Supports servers running OpenVMS, DEC OSF/1, and HP-UX software, and
   clients for OpenVMS, DEC OSF/1, HP-UX, Macintosh System 7, and MS-Windows
   software

PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

@aGlance/IT, from Intuitive Technology Corporation, meets the needs of users
who want to leverage their investments in two types of systems:

o  PCs and Macintosh computers with such powerful tools as spreadsheets,
   databases, and Visual Basic.

o  Computer systems and applications that run their manufacturing processes
   and that contain a wealth of data.

@aGlance/IT gives these users desktop access to both the dynamic and
historical information in their manufacturing systems and also provides an
architecture for easy integration of client/server manufacturing
applications.

