With @aGlance/IT users can make their previously difficult-to-access data
available at the desktop, to solve problems in and improve (or even
revolutionize) the manufacturing process.

@aGlance/IT is layered on top of ObjectBroker software, so in addition to
its superior performance, security, and robustness it runs on the industry's
leading object-oriented transport. This makes it easy to add new features
such as OLE 2.0 support.

