                 access PATHWORKS AppleShare servers and Pacer DEC OSF/1 and
                 ULTRIX servers, plus the use of the PATHWORKS for Macintosh
                 client software
QM-OEA*A-AA	 PATHWORKS for Macintosh FPA license; includes the right to
                 access PATHWORKS AppleShare servers and Pacer DEC OSF/1 and
                 ULTRIX servers
QA-386*A-H5/H8	 Pacer for DEC OSF/1 media and documentation kits,
                 TK50/CDROM

SERVICES

U.S. users with telephone support service are eligible to receive support
for the Pacer for DEC OSF/1 server software. Non-U.S. users need to contact
their local Pacer distributor to arrange for support services. Installation
and MDDS are not available for this product.

